<p>Two capabilities emerged without explicit training: guiding a shopper through changing app screens (no app-interface video in training data), and maintaining a four-second commentary cadence across a travel scene (timing + commentary never co-occur in training). The model composes these abilities at inference time, suggesting it is acquiring a general <em>watch-and-interact</em> competence rather than memorizing scenario-specific patterns.</p>
